-## auth
-
-Manages Google Antigravity OAuth authentication. Required for using Gemini models.
-
-### Usage
-
-```bash
-# Login
-bunx oh-my-opencode auth login
-
-# Logout
-bunx oh-my-opencode auth logout
-
-# Check current status
-bunx oh-my-opencode auth status
-```
